Read, create and edit projects (mods, modpacks, ...)

Usage:
  mdr project <command> [flags]

Commands:
  get            Get one project by id or slug
  get-many       Get several projects by id or slug
  random         Get random projects
  check          Check that a project exists and get its id
  dependencies   List the projects and versions a project depends on
  members        List the team members of a project
  create         Create a project from a JSON description
  edit           Change fields of a project
  delete         Delete a project with all its versions

Run "mdr project <command> --help" for details.
